{
  "id": "ep375",
  "duration": 29.489,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 3.94,
      "text": "This colossal cluster pumps out hundreds of stars every year.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "SPT-CLJ2344\u20134243 (Phoenix Cluster) Chandra.jpg",
        "credit": "X-ray: NASA/CXC/MIT/M.McDonald et al; Optical: NASA/STScI",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SPT-CLJ2344%E2%80%934243_(Phoenix_Cluster)_Chandra.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.933,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 3.94,
      "end": 7.42,
      "text": "Its central black hole weighs roughly ten billion Suns.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Illustrations of Disks around Black Holes (2005-bhlock-more-2 - bhdisk ill).jpg",
        "credit": "(Credit: NASA/CXC/M.Weiss)",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Illustrations_of_Disks_around_Black_Holes_(2005-bhlock-more-2_-_bhdisk_ill).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 3.933,
          "end": 7.433,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 7.42,
      "end": 10.08,
      "text": "Normally, that beast should act like a cosmic heater.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Black Hole Triggering Star Formation in Henize 2-10 (2022-002).png",
        "credit": "SCIENCE: NASA, ESA, Zachary Schutte (XGI), Amy Reines (XGI) IMAGE PROCESSING: Alyssa Pagan (STScI)",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Black_Hole_Triggering_Star_Formation_in_Henize_2-10_(2022-002).png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 7.433,
          "end": 10.067,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 10.08,
      "end": 13.44,
      "text": "It should blast radiation that stops gas from forming new stars.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Spectrum-Illustration.tiff",
        "credit": "NOIRLab/NSF/AURA",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Spectrum-Illustration.tiff"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 10.067,
          "end": 13.433,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 13.44,
      "end": 17.64,
      "text": "Instead, astronomers only detected extreme hot and cold gas.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Chandra X-Ray Observatory (noirlab2427c).tiff",
        "credit": "NASA/CXC & J.Vaughan",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chandra_X-Ray_Observatory_(noirlab2427c).tiff"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 13.433,
          "end": 17.633,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 17.64,
      "end": 21.16,
      "text": "For over a decade, a massive missing link baffled scientists.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "South Pole Telescope with Joaquin Vieira.jpg",
        "credit": "Joaquin Vieira",
        "license": "CC0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:South_Pole_Telescope_with_Joaquin_Vieira.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 17.633,
          "end": 21.167,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 21.16,
      "end": 25.18,
      "text": "NASA's Webb Space Telescope mapped a hidden halo of intermediate gas.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Artist concept of JWST (50489833002 107cb9e661 o).jpg",
        "credit": "Adriana Manrique Gutierrez, NASA Animator",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Artist_concept_of_JWST_(50489833002_107cb9e661_o).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 21.167,
          "end": 25.167,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 25.18,
      "end": 29.139,
      "text": "This warm gas glows like a neon sign, feeding that colossal cluster.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "SPT-CLJ2344\u20134243 (Phoenix Cluster) Chandra.jpg",
        "credit": "X-ray: NASA/CXC/MIT/M.McDonald et al; Optical: NASA/STScI",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SPT-CLJ2344%E2%80%934243_(Phoenix_Cluster)_Chandra.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 25.167,
          "end": 29.5,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
